osting proc adds a little more toward the 4000 threshold."},{"name":"Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","text":"Zero-investment pick: the swap proc hands the next character 48% ATK."},{"name":"Oathsworn Eye","text":"Provides ATK as its secondary stat and boosts Energy Recharge after using her Skill. Useful when Burst uptime is difficult."},{"name":"Flowing Purity","text":"A craftable ATK catalyst that gains Elemental DMG after Skill use. A healer helps clear its Bond of Life effect."},{"name":"Favonius Codex","text":"Particles for the whole team lower everyone else's ER needs."},{"name":"Eye of Perception","text":"ATK% catalyst whose bouncing Normal/Charged Attack passive offers limited support value."}],"a":[{"names":["Celestial Gift"],"text":"Celestial Gift is Nicole's BiS because its 4-piece bonus provides a 20% Pyro DMG Bonus, upgraded to 40% Pyro and 40% active-element DMG Bonus with Hexerei: Secret Rite active, greatly amplifying team damage.","stats":"ATK%/ER · ATK% · ATK%"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Noblesse Oblige boosts Nicole's Burst damage and provides a 20% teamwide ATK buff, making it a strong alternative support set.","stats":""},{"names":["Gladiator's Finale","A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"text":"Two ATK 2-piece bonuses give 36% ATK. Budget placeholder until a stronger support set is available.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"Hot & Bothered","members":["Nicole","Varka","Prune","Durin"],"text":"Varka drives Anemo damage, Prune amplifies Anemo, Durin provides off-field Pyro damage, and Nicole boosts team damage through buffs and Hexerei synergy.","roles":["Support","Main DPS","Buffer","Sub DPS"]},{"name":"Melt Down","members":["Nicole","Lohen","Citlali","Durin"],"text":"Lohen drives Cryo damage and triggers Melt, Durin provides off-field Pyro damage, Citlali enables Melt and shreds Pyro RES, and Nicole buffs both damage dealers.","roles":["Support","Main DPS","Res Shred","Sub DPS"]},{"name":"PawPixls main ","members":["Nicole","Wanderer","Faruzan","Durin"],"text":"Wanderer drives Anemo damage, Faruzan amplifies Anemo, Durin provides off-field Pyro damage and RES shred, and Nicole boosts team damage through buffs and Hexerei synergy.","roles":["Shielder / Buffer","Main DPS","Support","Off-field DPS / Buffer"]},{"name":"Budget Cuts","members":["Nicole","Razor","Fischl","Chevreuse"],"text":"Razor and Fischl provide Electro damage while Nicole supplies Pyro and buffs. Chevreuse supports Overloaded teams with healing and resistance reduction.","roles":["Shielder / Buffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Healer / Buffer"]}],"v":"Hexerei Team Buffer: Maximize teamwide bonuses with minimal field time.\nGeneral ATK Support: Use Noblesse and accessible catalyst support options.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Support"],"about":"Nicole is a versatile support who empowers Hexerei teams with strong buffs and utility while requiring very little field time. She also breathes new life into older ATK-scaling carries.","pros":["Strong team buffs","Low field time","Great utility","Flexible support"],"cons":["Hexerei focused","Low personal DMG","Team dependent","Limited outside niche"],"weapons":["Angelos' Heptades","Starcaller's Watch","Skyward Atlas","Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","Oathsworn Eye","Flowing Purity","Favonius Codex","Eye of Perception"],"arts":[{"sets":["Celestial Gift"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"},{"sets":["Gladiator's Finale","A Day Carved From Rising Winds"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":"Support"}],"main":["ATK% / Energy Recharge","ATK%","ATK%"],"stats":["ATK: 3,000 - 4,000 (buff goal)","Energy Recharge: 160%+","CRIT Rate: 40% - 50% (Favonius)"],"vars":[{"title":"Hexerei Team Buffer","role":"Support","weapons":["Angelos' Heptades","Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers"],"arts":[{"sets":["Celestial Gift"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER as needed; prioritize support stats over personal damage.","teams":"Qualifying Hexerei allies and an ATK-scaling carry if using TTDS.","when":"Maximize teamwide bonuses with minimal field time.","cond":"TTDS requires deliberate swap order.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"General ATK Support","role":"Support","weapons":["Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","Oathsworn Eye"],"arts":[{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER to Burst as needed; prioritize utility.","teams":"A team benefiting from ATK buffs outside Hexerei.","when":"Use Noblesse and accessible catalyst support options.","cond":"Avoid duplicate Noblesse buffs.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Agnidus Agate Sliver","Agnidus Agate Fragment","Agnidus Agate Chunk","Agnidus Agate Gemstone","Remnant of the Dreadwing","Teachings of Elysium","Guide to Elysium","Philosophies of Elysium","Tattered Warrant","Immaculate Warrant","Frost-Etched Warrant","Pine Amber","Counterfeit Resin","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Hot & Bothered","members":["Nicole","Varka","Prune","Durin"]},{"name":"Melt Down","members":["Nicole","Lohen","Citlali","Durin"]},{"name":"PawPixls main","members":["Nicole","Wanderer","Faruzan","Durin"]},{"name":"Budget Cuts","members":["Nicole","Razor","Fischl","Chevreuse"]}]}}],"title":"Nicole","el":"Pyro"}